		(descr "HCTL HC-RJ45-5JA-1-4 shielded 8P8C jack, right angle through-hole, gold phosphor-bronze contacts, no LEDs and NO MAGNETICS - this is an RS-232 console port, not Ethernet. Body 16.5 x 13.4 x 15.8mm. Eight D1.2 signal holes staggered on a 1.02mm x-pitch; two D2.0 and two D3.2 mounting holes, all four plated and all four on the SH pad so the shell grounds. LCSC C3000174.")
